msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on USART1. RC could  be applied instead "
"to a different UART port such as  and set the protocol to receive RC data "
"``SERIALn_PROTOCOL`` = 23 and change :ref:`SERIAL1 _PROTOCOL "
"<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` to something other than '23'. For RC protocols other "
"than unidirectional, the USART1_TX pin will need to be used:"
msgstr ""
"默认RC输入配置在USART1上。RC输入也可改为接入其他UART端口，并将协议设置为接收RC数据 ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL`` = "
"23，同时将 :ref:`SERIAL1 _PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` "
"更改为非'23'的值。对于非单向协议的RC协议，需要使用USART1_TX引脚："

